  "lines": [
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Morning. Tell me about the wrist."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "I came off my bike three weeks ago and landed on my left hand."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Did you have any scans at the hospital?"},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "They said no break, and I came out in a splint."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Let me have a look. Welcome to the club, by the way, half my patients this month are cyclists."},
    {"role": "receptionist", "text": "Sorry to interrupt, your two o'clock has rung to say they're running late."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Thanks, Jo, no problem."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Bending the wrist back is about half the other side."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "There's tenderness in the hollow at the base of your thumb, and with a fall like yours that needs ruling out as a small fracture."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "I'd like you to see a GP today and ask about a repeat X-ray, and keep the splint on until then."},
    {"role": "patient", "text": "Will do. Hello again, splint, I suppose."},
    {"role": "clinician", "text": "Come in tomorrow if they can't fit you in, and say hello to the front desk on the way out."}
  ],
